Use the selftests' clone3 arguments with older toolchain kernel headers.
The setns helper already constructs __clone_args; size that actual object.
Reuse the existing clone3 helper in pidfd_wait instead of requiring the
toolchain headers to declare struct clone_args.

These changes follow the clone3 compatibility portion of upstream commit
59a42b0e78888e2d9a459b12e8d1eb09fb4a3c7b (selftests/pidfd: add pidfs file
handle selftests), without its new tests or unrelated helper changes:
https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/59a42b0e7

